# Premium Documents

Read `skills/premium-documents/SKILL.md` in full first (spec: `references/doc-spec.md`; what each type must contain: `references/doc-types.md`).

Quick reference:
- Build: `bash skills/premium-design-kit/scripts/run.sh skills/premium-documents/scripts/build_doc.py spec.json out/name` → name.docx + name.pdf.
- QA (mandatory): `bash skills/premium-design-kit/scripts/run.sh skills/premium-documents/scripts/validate_doc.py out/name.pdf out/name.docx --sheet` → LOOK at the contact sheet; fix and rebuild.
- Outline first, real content, `[NEEDS: …]` for gaps. Legal docs = draft for lawyer review. Invoice totals are computed, never typed.
- Default theme plain-pro (unbranded); `"brand": "<slug>"` only when asked.
